    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "10 Annsbrook, Glenealy, Co. Wicklow, A67 KT51\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart of the picturesque village of Glenealy, 10 Annsbrook is a superbly presented family home extending to approximately 149 sq.m (1,604 sq.ft), offering generous living accommodation, modern comforts, and a peaceful residential setting just minutes from Wicklow Town and within commuting distance of Dublin via the M11 motorway or by train from Wicklow Town or Rathdrum..\r\n\r\nThis spacious property has been thoughtfully designed for modern family living, boasting bright and well-proportioned interiors throughout. The accommodation provides an excellent balance of living and bedroom space, ideal for growing families or those seeking additional room to work from home.\r\n\r\nLocated within walking distance of local shops, schools, cafés, and sporting amenities, Glenealy offers the perfect blend of village charm and commuter convenience, with easy access to Wicklow Town via the R752 and Dublin via the nearby M11/N11. St Josephs National School is a short walk through the Village and secondary schools available in both Wicklow Town or Rathdrum.\r\n\r\nOur client is seeking offers in excess of €499,000\r\nPSRA Licence 001288"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "On entering, viewers are welcomed by a bright entrance hallway leading to a spacious living room filled with natural light. The heart of the home is the open-plan kitchen and dining area, offering an ideal space for everyday living and entertaining alike, with direct access via French doors to a large patio and to the rear garden. The fourth bedroom on the ground floor provides flexibility as a playroom, home office, or second lounge depending on individual requirements.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers three generously sized bedrooms which includes a Master Bedroom with En Suite and well-appointed main bathroom accommodation, all finished to a high standard.\r\n\r\nOutside, the home enjoys a private sunny rear garden perfect for outdoor dining and family enjoyment, while off-street parking is available to the front."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious family home extending to approx. 149 sqm\r\n\r\nBER C2 Energy Rating\r\n\r\nBright and well proportioned accommodation throughout\r\n\r\nLarge kitchen/dining area - ideal for entertaining\r\n\r\nPrivate sunny rear garden\r\n\r\nConvenient access to M11/M50 motorway\r\n\r\nClose to schools, shops & local amenities\r\n\r\nGFCH"
      },
